      "type": "text",
      "text": "Before the first dose, do a cardiovascular evaluation in triptan-naive patients with multiple CV risk factors (eg, older age, diabetes, HTN, smoking, obesity, strong family history of CAD); evidence of CAD or coronary vasospasm contraindicates it."
